<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-COPA CENTENARIO RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COPA CENTENARIO RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BELO HORZIONTE, Brazil 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Copa</p>
<p>Centenario group A matches played Wednesday:</p>
<p> America-Belo Horizonte (Brazil) 1  Milan (Italy)	    1</p>
<p> Atletico Mineiro (Brazil)	 4  Corinthians (Brazil)   2</p>
<p>(Atletico Mineiro qualify for the final.)</p>
<p>Standings</p>
<p>			    P  W  D  L  F  A Pts</p>
<p> Atletico Mineiro     3  1  2  0  8  6  5</p>
<p> America		  3  0  3  0  4  4  3</p>
<p> Milan		    3  0  3  0  3  3  3</p>
<p> Corinthians (Brazil) 3  0  2  1  3  5  2</p>
<p>The competition is being played to celebrate the 100th</p>
<p>anniversary of the founding of Belo Horizonte.</p>
</text>
